# **`08_option_result.lc` (Error Handling & Safe Operations)**
# **Purpose**: Eliminates crashes and undefined behaviors for beginner programs using monadic containers.
# **Contents**:
# `SOME`, `NONE`, `is_some`, `is_none`, `unwrap_or`.
# `OK`, `ERR`, `is_ok`, `is_err`, `match_result`.
# `and_then` / `map_option` / `map_result` monadic chaining.

